# Task 150-023: 388 .md Interaktif Review Script — Execution Plan

## Approach

1. Create `scripts/doc-review.mjs` (~200 LoC):
   - List all .md files (excluding node_modules, .git, .tasks)
   - Analyze: size, last-modified, sprint reference count
   - Hash-based duplicate detection (crypto.createHash)
   - Internal link check (broken [text](path.md) refs)
