   - Output report to docs/audits/sprint-150/doc-review-report.md

2. Create `docs/audits/sprint-150/doc-review-report.md`:
   - Generated automatically by the script
   - 4 category sections: KEEP / REVISE / DELETE / MOVE
   - Table format with file path, size, last-modified, reason

